CA29 7FFF03           (andoff/src/main.s):01862                 clr     PIA1_CRB        ; select PIA1 PB direction register
CA2C 86FF             (andoff/src/main.s):01863                 lda     #$FF
CA2E B7FF02           (andoff/src/main.s):01864                 sta     PIA1_DB         ; keyboard columns/output side
